      "blocks": {
        "column_tPXhYJ": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/enduser.jpg",
            "title": "<strong>Create your own Quotation </strong>",
            "text": "<p><strong>(For End Users)</strong></p><p>Quickly generate a quote by adding products, entering your details, and saving or printing the document.<br/><br/><strong>1. Select Products:</strong> Browse the catalog and add items to your quotation list.</p><p><strong>2. Enter Details:</strong> Provide your information (name, company, etc.) and add a project title.</p><p><strong>3. Generate & Save:</strong> Finalize the quote to save or print it for your records.</p>",
            "link_label": "Create Quotation",
            "link": "shopify://pages/quotation-list",
            "card_background": "#f5f8ff",
            "card_text_color": "#242833",
            "card_border": ""
          }
        },
        "column_dFCmmm": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/contractor_2fd078ed-3fcd-44fa-b316-6efb73f1b9b7.jpg",
            "title": "<strong>Contractor's Quotation Form</strong>",
            "text": "<p><strong>(For Contractors)</strong></p><p>Use this template quotation form designed for contractors.<br/><br/></p><p><strong>1. Add Business Details:</strong> Include your company name, logo, contact info, and custom terms.</p><p><strong>2. Select Products/Services:</strong> Choose items from the catalog for your client's project.</p><p><strong>3. Finalize & Share:</strong> Save, print, or download a professional PDF to send directly to clients.</p>",
            "link_label": "Contractor's Quotation",
            "link": "shopify://pages/channel-quotation-template",
            "card_background": "#f5f8ff",
            "card_text_color": "#242833",
            "card_border": ""
          }
        },
        "column_wPfpUe": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/price.jpg",
            "title": "<strong>Price Inquiry</strong>",
            "text": "<p><strong>(For Specific Products)</strong></p><p>Interested in a product but no price indicated? Use this form to get accurate pricing from our sales team.<br/><br/></p><p><strong>1. Build Your List:</strong> Add the desired products to your inquiry.</p><p><strong>2. Submit for Verification:</strong> Our sales  team will receive your email to update the cost of items you selected.<br/></p><p><strong>3. Receive Accurate Pricing:</strong> We'll email you the confirmed prices for your inquiry.</p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
            "link_label": "Price Inquiry",
            "link": "shopify://pages/price-inquiry-quote",
            "card_background": "#f5f8ff",
            "card_text_color": "#242833",
            "card_border": ""
          }
        },
        "column_C99Lca": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/recommendation.jpg",
            "title": "<strong>Project Recommendation</strong>",
            "text": "<p><strong>(For Project Quotation)</strong></p><p>Let our expertise help you by providing <br/>an accurate recommendation and quotation for this project.</p><p><br/></p><p><strong>1. Share Your Requirements:</strong> Answer a few questions about your project needs and goals.</p><p><strong>2. Get Expert Recommendations:</strong> Our engineers will analyze your needs and suggest the best solutions.</p><p><strong>3. Receive a Quote:</strong> We'll prepare a quotation based on the project requirements.</p>",
            "link_label": "Request Product Quotation",
            "link": "shopify://pages/request-product-quotation",
            "card_background": "#f5f8ff",
            "card_text_color": "#242833",
            "card_border": ""
          }
        }
      },
